# D-FREED-INODE-HOME-NEVER-PUBLISHED-LIVE-CORE-AFTER-CLEAN-UNMOUNT: the
# three-node part of the final verification, 3/net/mesh/direct g3b (test15
# test16 test17), on the build of the final source: srcversion
# 311877C431E1BB444562804 (main tree ~/src/mxfs, 0.90.131: the H-F11 fix, both
# halves of the fix for
# D-RECYCLE-RESET-UNDER-NOINO-STRANDS-COMMITTED-DIR-CHANGE-WEDGE-SHUTDOWN, the
# unlinked-list fixes of
# D-PEER-OPEN-UNLINKED-CHAIN-REMOVE-FAILS-IFREE-SHUTDOWN-BOTH-NODES
# (freshsrc_iunl_overlay, unlprev_tenure, b6_release_drain, unlprev_pin,
# unlprev_rele_defer) and the deferred-free fixes of
# D-INACT-DEFERRED-FREE-LOSES-TRUNCATED-CORE-AND-REAP-AUTHORITY
# (ifree_defer_drain, ifree_defer_reap), all at their defaults; run from
# ~/src/mxfs).  g3b shares test15 and test16 with g2b,
# so this queue runs after the CAW half.  H-F10's release side needs a third
# node to reach (a release whose scope holds a publish claim in flight,
# hf10_reach_ab.queue); these laps run its reach knobs
# (NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=20, NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5) with every guard at
# its module default 1, pub_claim_release_guard, pub_claim_write_guard,
# p55c_home_restore, noino_recycle_dirty_wait and noino_recycle_takeover
# included (NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 writes the default and reads its counters;
# NG0_P55C_RESTORE and NG0_DIRTY_WAIT are not set, as in the two-node halves).
# Node failures are counted from each node's whole kernel log after the lap's
# mark.
#
# The previous run of this part (build 737E182A809291DAA0B4785, labels
# fx3f1..fx3f4) ran before the recycle fix, so it does not speak for this
# build.  The run on build C06A6D4A9AB7A357503DF51 (labels fy3f1..fy3f4) was 4
# of 4 PASS; it ran before the unlinked-list fixes, which change the
# inactivation and unlinked-list paths every lap here exercises, so it does not
# speak for this build either.  The run on build 41D2F9237EBB21CF21E9D57
# (labels fz3f1..fz3f4) aborted at prep in every lap: its chain started it
# while the next queue held test15 (run.sh's node lock refused each lap).
#
# THE DEFERRED-FREE GRADING (added for build 311877C4, before its first lap).
# tools/chk_mxfs grades a bucket member as legal crash residue, not an error, so
# a CLEAN audit alone cannot show that frees deferred at the unlinked-list
# preflight were finished.  Laps 2 and 4 also set NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1
# NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 (the module defaults, written and read back): the harness
# attributes every bucket member and fork-ownership error to the deferrals that
# name it and passes the lap only with no fork-ownership error, no unlanded
# drain and no bucket member left (if_ok=1).  For those two laps the deferrals'
# reach is the vacuity gate in place of H-F10's; laps 1 and 3 keep H-F10's.
#
# The run on build 311877C431E1BB444562804 (labels fw3f1..fw3f4, log
# tests/evidence/lapq_fw3.log) was 3 of 4 PASS: fw3f2 FAILED on pc_ok=0, an AG
# release's publish drain running out its window with a claim in flight, the
# chase H-F12 and H-F13 of this record address (the instrument run fds on
# F09C3FED2DB371E0D9A8BC5 caught it again in fds3).  This run (labels fv3f*,
# written before its first lap) is on build 37897D38118AD5E2FAAC4FC (main tree
# ~/src/mxfs, 0.90.131): that source plus every change made since, each at its
# module default.  Behaviour: H-3 of
# D-INACT-DEFERRED-FREE-LOSES-TRUNCATED-CORE-AND-REAP-AUTHORITY
# (reap_transient_keep), H-U7 of
# D-PEER-OPEN-UNLINKED-CHAIN-REMOVE-FAILS-IFREE-SHUTDOWN-BOTH-NODES
# (reload_next_refresh), H-F13's inode-allocation fence with its revision
# H-F13b (ag_ialloc_fence 1, ag_fence_hint_exempt 1), H-F12's bounded drain
# built but off (pub_drain_bound 0, the open scan every earlier run had), and
# the fixes of D-CREATE-REUSE-OVER-PEER-FREED-LINKED-CORPSE-SHUTS-NODE-DOWN
# (cr63_linked_defer), D-UMOUNT-ROOT-DENTRY-STILL-IN-USE-DEFERRED-DIR-DCACHE-SHRINK-RACE
# (dshrink_umount_gate), D-NETMESH-LIVE-FILE-INODE-FREED-UNDER-ITS-NAME-AFTER-NUMBER-REUSE
# (sf_kept_ahead_base) and D-FORMATION-RAMP-LOCK-REQUEST-EXHAUSTS-RETRIES-EAGAIN
# (ilock_retry_exhaust_park, dl_retry_view_unspent).  Instruments only: the
# handoff exposure census (P-PUB-UNPUB-AT-UNLOCK), the phantom detector's
# in-flight sample and the next-write detector's own-free exception.  It runs
# on g3 (test1 test2 test3), which shares no node with the two-node halves
# running beside it.  The rules below are unchanged.
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   CLEAN     every lap's cold audit CLEAN errors=0 with node_failures=0 and
#             hf11_chain=0, laps 2 and 4 if_ok=1 with if_zombies=0 and
#             if_fork_errors=0, and every non-vacuous lap passes the harness
#             (pc_ok=1, pw_ok=1, p55_ok=1 and the other ok flags); a lap
#             VACUOUS by a gate keeps its audit and hf11_chain as its verdict
#             and is reported as unreached.
#   REACH     pc_rel_waited (H-F10 release side), pw_masked (write side),
#             p55_restored_lof (H-F11) per lap, and the dirty-corpse lines.
#   CORRUPT   any CORRUPT audit, hf11_chain > 0, P-RECYCLE-RESET-UNDER-NOINO
#             with owes=1, or P-LOGWR-DLM-NOGRANT with pub_inflight=1: blocks
#             the record; attribute each audited inode or line.
#   UNSTABLE  any node failure line in a lap's whole kernel log: blocks both
#             records until attributed.
# A lap whose audit is STALE/NONE has no verdict and is rerun.
#
# Bound: the H-F10 reach queue's 1660 s per lap plus the harness's P55C stream
# pass (2x10) = 1680 s.
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=20 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh fv3f1 1 300 3/net/mesh/direct g3
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=20 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh fv3f2 1 300 3/net/mesh/direct g3
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=20 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh fv3f3 1 300 3/net/mesh/direct g3
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_PUBCLAIM_DELAY_MS=20 NG0_CREATE_PARENT_DELAY_MS=5 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh fv3f4 1 300 3/net/mesh/direct g3
